    "detailed_description": "The main objective of the game is relaxation and productivity, through the customization of your personal space and atmosphere that suit your tone!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cottage Customization - change and toggle the appearance of furniture, items, etc.<br></li><li>Atmosphere - control the weather and time of the day to fit your mood!<br></li><li>Activity Status - share with others about what you are up to!<br></li><li>White Board - got something to remember? Make notes in your own personal cozy space!<br></li><li>Audio Player - load in and listen to your own music tracks using the built-in audio library menu!<br></li><li>Interactivity - some of your items may be interactable, granting you access to mini games!<br></li><li>Collective Coziness - invite your friends, send them friend requests, and see their cottages and activities!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The main objective of the game is relaxation and productivity, through the customization of your personal space and atmosphere that suit your tone!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cottage Customization - change and toggle the appearance of furniture, items, etc.<br></li><li>Atmosphere - control the weather and time of the day to fit your mood!<br></li><li>Activity Status - share with others about what you are up to!<br></li><li>White Board - got something to remember? Make notes in your own personal cozy space!<br></li><li>Audio Player - load in and listen to your own music tracks using the built-in audio library menu!<br></li><li>Interactivity - some of your items may be interactable, granting you access to mini games!<br></li><li>Collective Coziness - invite your friends, send them friend requests, and see their cottages and activities!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "CottageVille is a cozy idling game, where you can design your very own cottage and do various activities (such as planning, listening to music, etc.) on your own, and together with your friends!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA great social hub for all with a modern sleek design and great customizability.\u201d<br />\r\n8.5/10 \u2013 BigMemerMan1<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cAt first I didn\u2019t think it was going to be this good, but it was the best productivity app I\u2019ve ever found, it really made me productive on days even when I was tired, would recommend\u201d<br />\r\n9.5/10 \u2013 Ommtdh<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cVery lively game with a cozy environment and really good music, brought my father back\u201d<br />\r\n11/10 \u2013 Fully Rendered<br />\r\n",
